# Paths excluded from the Vercel deployment source.
#
# The deployment archive reached 517.8 MB and the upload failed at 388.3 MB
# with "Error: fetch failed" — no deployment id, no build stage, no READY
# deployment. This file removes content the deployed application never reads.
# It is NOT a claim that 517.8 MB exceeded a published hard limit; the problem
# is upload reliability and shipping content the runtime has no use for.
#
# Every entry below is proven by scripts/verify-rcap-deployment-closure.mjs,
# which fails if any excluded path is referenced from application or build code
# and re-proves the required paths survive pruning.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, because the running application reads them:
#   data/                              guidance packets, composed routes,
#                                      crosswalk, terminalization treatments
#   design-handoff/                    read via path.join(process.cwd(), …)
#   tmp/review-inbox/                  all50 internal preview + promotion page
#   docs/record-clearing/field-map-drafts/
#                                      readdirSync in official-pdf-shadow-batch
#   reference/                         packet-pdf source provenance
#   public/ src/ package.json package-lock.json next.config.ts tsconfig.json

# Shadow-batch render OUTPUT. The module writes to a caller-supplied outputDir
# and no route imports it; the only mention of this path in src/ is a doc
# comment naming where the tool renders to.
tmp/official-pdf-shadow-batch/
tmp/record-clearing-shadow/
tmp/official-pdf-implementation-gate/

# Generated review/evidence artifacts. No string literal or path read in src/
# resolves here.
artifacts/

# Documentation with no runtime reader. docs/record-clearing is NOT listed:
# it holds field-map-drafts, which is read at runtime.
docs/expungement-ai/
docs/rcap/
docs/product-flows/
docs/rcap-promotion/
docs/rcap-crosswalk-enrichment/
docs/state-packs/
